  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* ci: lock closed issues by @schollz in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1202\r\n* docs: add Croc GUI to app list by @interfluve-wav in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1199\r\n* chore: change default dig url by @schollz in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1203\r\n* docs: Update README with F-Droid and desktop app details by @Dking08 in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1204\r\n* feat: add disco deployment by @schollz in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1206\r\n* feat: add max rooms to prevent DoS by @schollz in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1209\r\n* feat: add more bits to room selection by @schollz in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1210\r\n* feat: add color by @schollz in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1211\r\n* feat: bind PAKE handshakes to participants and sessions by @schollz in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1212\r\n* chore: bump version by @schollz in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1213\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @interfluve-wav made their first contribution in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1199\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/schollz/croc/compare/v10.7.0...v11.0.0",
